.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt SYNC 8
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm sync
.Nd write cached data to the disks
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
writes everything the system holds in memory for its disks out to them, with
.Xr sync 2 .
The file system delays writing regular files' data;
.Xr update 8
synchronizes every 30 seconds, and
.Xr reboot 8
before restarting.
Arguments are ignored.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr sync 2 ,
.Xr reboot 8 ,
.Xr update 8
.Sh HISTORY
A
.Nm
command appeared in
.At v4 .
